{"id": "make-ready-contractor-licensing-and-insurance", "title": "An undisclosed operator with a revoked license ran a licensed construction firm", "seconds": 52.8, "voice": "elevenlabs:9PVP7ENhDskL0KYHAKtD", "narrator": "Jerry B.", "made": "2026-11-27", "key": "8804eed383dcf34f", "words": 150, "beats": [{"scene": "p", "kind": "hook", "ref": ["suspicious[0]", "established[0]"], "text": "A contractor’s personal license and a company license had different histories.", "t0": 0.2, "t1": 3.82, "shot": "s0", "visual": {"type": "hook", "words": ["Two", "license", "histories"], "sub": "A corporate license was separate from the operator’s personal history"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.14, 0.79, 1.22, 1.61, 1.73, 1.81, 2.22, 2.61, 2.8, 3.12]}, {"scene": "p", "kind": "record", "ref": ["suspicious[0]", "established[0]"], "text": "The prosecutor reported that the operator’s license was revoked in 2003.", "t0": 3.94, "t1": 8.11, "shot": "s1", "visual": {"type": "record", "layout": "table", "source": "accusation", "heading": "Personal license", "context": "April 22, 2003", "rows": [{"label": "Don Juan Santos", "value": "680810"}]}, "wt": [0.0, 0.13, 0.75, 1.18, 1.35, 1.51, 2.03, 2.43, 2.61, 3.03, 3.15, 3.4, 3.82]}, {"scene": "p", "kind": "doc", "ref": ["suspicious[0]", "established[0]"], "text": "The corporation obtained its own license three years later.", "t0": 8.23, "t1": 11.03, "shot": "s2", "visual": {"type": "doc", "source": "license", "kicker": "A corporate license was separate from the operator’s personal history", "text": "January 31, 2006", "mark": "January"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.13, 0.78, 1.16, 1.32, 1.51, 1.92, 2.19, 2.44]}, {"scene": "b", "kind": "doc", "ref": ["suspicious[1]", "established[1]"], "text": "City permit contacts repeatedly identify the corporation.", "t0": 11.25, "t1": 14.3, "shot": "s3", "visual": {"type": "doc", "source": "building", "kicker": "City permits identify the corporate license", "text": "Corporate permit contacts", "mark": "Corporate"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.33, 0.69, 1.2, 1.75, 2.27, 2.37]}, {"scene": "b", "kind": "bignum", "ref": ["suspicious[1]", "established[1]"], "text": "The building records list 251 different permit numbers.", "t0": 14.42, "t1": 17.95, "shot": "s4", "visual": {"type": "bignum", "value": "251 different permit numbers", "label": "City permits identify the corporate license"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.14, 0.51, 0.91, 1.15, 1.42, 1.73, 2.38, 2.72, 3.08]}, {"scene": "b", "kind": "doc", "ref": ["suspicious[1]", "established[1]"], "text": "The same corporate license appears in electrical and plumbing records.", "t0": 18.07, "t1": 21.27, "shot": "s5", "visual": {"type": "doc", "source": "building", "kicker": "City permits identify the corporate license", "text": "License 871833", "mark": "License"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.17, 0.5, 0.92, 1.3, 1.68, 1.8, 2.31, 2.41, 2.79]}, {"scene": "b", "kind": "doc", "ref": ["suspicious[2]", "established[2]"], "text": "The insurance complaint concerned a specific period in 2017.", "t0": 21.39, "t1": 24.94, "shot": "s6", "visual": {"type": "doc", "source": "plea", "kicker": "The criminal complaint concerned a specific coverage period", "text": "February 19 through May 14, 2017", "mark": "February"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.14, 0.58, 1.01, 1.45, 1.52, 2.07, 2.47, 2.58, 2.9]}, {"scene": "b", "kind": "quote", "ref": ["suspicious[2]", "established[2]"], "text": "The prosecution reports do not identify the individual permit exhibits.", "t0": 25.06, "t1": 29.0, "shot": "s7", "visual": {"type": "quote", "line": "Individual permits"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.13, 0.8, 1.22, 1.45, 1.71, 2.29, 2.44, 3.06, 3.4]}, {"scene": "b", "kind": "doc", "ref": ["suspicious[3]", "established[3]"], "text": "The corporate license expired in January 2018.", "t0": 29.12, "t1": 31.99, "shot": "s8", "visual": {"type": "doc", "source": "license", "kicker": "The corporate license expired before it was revoked", "text": "January 31, 2018", "mark": "January"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.12, 0.49, 0.88, 1.38, 1.48, 2.03, 2.33]}, {"scene": "b", "kind": "record", "ref": ["suspicious[3]", "established[3]"], "text": "The licensing board revoked both the corporation’s license and a second business’s license.", "t0": 32.11, "t1": 36.59, "shot": "revocation", "visual": {"type": "record", "layout": "table", "source": "order", "heading": "Two administrative revocations", "context": "September 10, 2018", "rows": [{"label": "Make Ready Maintenance Inc.", "value": "871833"}, {"label": "H & K Construction", "value": "877206"}]}, "wt": [0.0, 0.15, 0.68, 0.95, 1.3, 1.52, 1.62, 2.28, 2.76, 3.06, 3.15, 3.49, 3.98]}, {"scene": "b", "kind": "record", "ref": ["suspicious[3]", "established[3]"], "text": "The corporate qualifier also owned the second business.", "t0": 36.71, "t1": 39.33, "shot": "qualifier", "visual": {"type": "record", "layout": "table", "source": "order", "heading": "Shared qualifier", "context": "September 10, 2018", "rows": [{"label": "Make Ready Maintenance Inc.", "value": "Qualifying officer"}, {"label": "H & K Construction", "value": "Sole owner"}]}, "wt": [0.0, 0.12, 0.49, 1.17, 1.53, 1.72, 1.84, 2.17]}, {"scene": "b", "kind": "record", "ref": ["suspicious[3]", "established[3]"], "text": "The board reached both licenses in a default proceeding.", "t0": 39.45, "t1": 42.07, "shot": "default", "visual": {"type": "record", "layout": "table", "source": "order", "heading": "Reapplication after revocation", "context": "September 10, 2018", "rows": [{"label": "Make Ready Maintenance Inc.", "value": "Five years"}, {"label": "H & K Construction", "value": "Three years"}]}, "wt": [0.0, 0.13, 0.41, 0.65, 0.93, 1.48, 1.58, 1.69, 2.11]}, {"scene": "o", "kind": "doc", "ref": ["suspicious[4]", "established[4]"], "text": "The operator pleaded guilty.", "t0": 42.29, "t1": 43.73, "shot": "s10", "visual": {"type": "doc", "source": "plea", "kicker": "One defendant pleaded guilty and the other charges were dismissed", "text": "November 16, 2018", "mark": "November"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.18, 0.66, 0.97]}, {"scene": "o", "kind": "bignum", "ref": ["suspicious[4]", "established[4]"], "text": "The sentence included 90 days in county jail.", "t0": 43.85, "t1": 46.32, "shot": "s11", "visual": {"type": "bignum", "value": "90 days", "label": "One defendant pleaded guilty and the other charges were dismissed"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.12, 0.47, 0.98, 1.33, 1.63, 1.76, 2.09]}, {"scene": "o", "kind": "quote", "ref": ["suspicious[4]", "established[4]"], "text": "The charges against the other defendant and the company were dismissed.", "t0": 46.44, "t1": 49.67, "shot": "s12", "visual": {"type": "quote", "line": "Charges were dismissed"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.15, 0.56, 0.88, 1.02, 1.24, 1.73, 1.87, 1.99, 2.42, 2.61]}, {"scene": "o", "kind": "end", "ref": ["status"], "text": "Every source is linked in the case file below.", "t0": 49.79, "t1": 51.9, "shot": "end", "visual": {"type": "end"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.32, 0.63, 0.79, 1.03, 1.11, 1.21, 1.47, 1.75]}], "format": 6, "chapters": {"p": "A corporate license was separate from the operator’s personal history", "b": "City permits identify the corporate license", "o": "One defendant pleaded guilty and the other charges were dismissed"}, "look": "midnight", "hook": "number"}